    <string name="token_steps_title">Get a refresh token</string>
    <string name="token_steps_1">1. Sign in to Questrade in a browser. Tap Open Questrade below to go straight to the API centre.</string>
    <string name="token_steps_2">2. If asked, tap \"Activate API\" and accept the terms.</string>
    <string name="token_steps_3">3. Tap \"Register a personal app\". Allow account data only, not trading. Any name works.</string>
    <string name="token_steps_4">4. Under the new app, tap \"Generate new token\". If it isn\'t there, tap \"New device\" first.</string>
    <string name="token_steps_5">5. Copy the token and paste it under Add login. Each token works once, and unused ones expire, so paste it soon.</string>
